{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45291","headline":"咏史 · 皎然","name":"咏史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独负高世资，冥冥寄浮俗。\n卞子去不归，何人辩荆玉。\n鬻舂意不浅，汚迹身岂辱。\n鸾铩乐迍邅，虬蟠甘窘束。\n五噫谲且正，可以见心曲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45291.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45291","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「咏史」条，撰者李坤栋、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"李坤栋"}